# read by lane_d23125.sh when the scan starts (appended to point.env). PROVISIONAL (registered in README.md's first entry; FINAL in the second entry, made when the D 23.0625 secant of kc143_d230625/ ends, before the regrid starts):
# the NEW scanner (wip/ell1-speed 92b9bf53, blob eb1396ad), 6 evaluations on 2 processes of one thread at nice 15, round-robin, 3 rounds: process 0 -0.030, -0.040, -0.025; process 1 the repeat of -0.030, -0.035, -0.020
